<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Église Couronne Divine — Bujumbura</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,500&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy: #0e1a3a;
    --navy-mid: #182a5c;
    --navy-soft: #22346b;
    --gold: #c9a227;
    --gold-light: #ecd48f;
    --crimson: #a4241a;
    --cream: #f8f4ea;
    --ink: #14151a;
    --line: rgba(201,162,39,0.28);
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  h1,h2,h3, .display{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;}
  img{display:block;max-width:100%;}
  .container{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}

  /* ---------- reveal on scroll ---------- */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:opacity .8s ease, transform .8s ease;}
  .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  header{
    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;
    background:rgba(14,26,58,0.92);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-wrap{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:14px 32px;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .brand img{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);}
  .brand-text{color:var(--cream);line-height:1.05;}
  .brand-text .name{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-light);}
  .brand-text .tag{font-size:0.62rem;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(248,244,234,0.55);}
  nav ul{display:flex;gap:30px;list-style:none;}
  nav a{
    color:rgba(248,244,234,0.82);font-size:0.85rem;letter-spacing:0.03em;
    position:relative;padding-bottom:4px;transition:color .3s;
  }
  nav a::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:0;height:1px;background:var(--gold);
    transition:width .3s;
  }
  nav a:hover{color:var(--gold-light);}
  nav a:hover::after{width:100%;}
  .nav-cta{
    background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);padding:9px 20px;border-radius:2px;
    font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;font-weight:500;
  }
  .burger{display:none;color:var(--cream);font-size:1.4rem;cursor:pointer;}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;min-height:100vh;
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 20%, var(--navy-soft) 0%, var(--navy) 55%, #08122b 100%);
    display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;
    padding-top:90px;
  }
  .hero-arc{
    position:absolute;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .arc1{width:900px;height:900px;top:-260px;right:-280px;}
  .arc2{width:650px;height:650px;top:-120px;right:-150px;border-color:rgba(201,162,39,0.16);}
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 0.85fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;
    position:relative;z-index:2;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    color:var(--gold);font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:'';width:34px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);}
  .hero h1{
    color:var(--cream);font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.4rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.06;
  }
  .hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:500;}
  .hero .verse{
    margin-top:26px;color:rgba(248,244,234,0.72);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.7;
    max-width:480px;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);padding-left:18px;font-style:italic;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.3rem;
  }
  .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:38px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    padding:14px 30px;font-size:0.85rem;letter-spacing:0.05em;border-radius:2px;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;transition:all .3s;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--gold-light);transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn-outline{border:1px solid rgba(248,244,234,0.4);color:var(--cream);}
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold-light);transform:translateY(-2px);}

  .hero-visual{
    position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;
  }
  .hero-globe-ring{
    position:absolute;width:112%;height:112%;border-radius:50%;
    border:1px dashed rgba(201,162,39,0.35);
    animation:spin 40s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
  .hero-photo{
    width:100%;max-width:340px;border-radius:6px;position:relative;z-index:2;
    box-shadow:0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .schedule-chip{
    position:absolute;bottom:-26px;left:-10px;background:var(--cream);color:var(--navy);
    padding:16px 22px;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    z-index:3;min-width:200px;
  }
  .schedule-chip .lbl{font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--crimson);font-weight:600;}
  .schedule-chip .val{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:4px;}

  /* ---------- section shared ---------- */
  section{padding:110px 0;}
  .section-head{max-width:640px;margin-bottom:60px;}
  .section-head .eyebrow{color:var(--crimson);}
  .section-head .eyebrow::before{background:var(--crimson);}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.4vw,2.9rem);font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);}
  .section-head p{margin-top:16px;color:#5a5a5a;line-height:1.7;font-size:1.02rem;}
  .divider-gold{width:60px;height:2px;background:var(--gold);margin:20px 0;}

  /* ---------- horaires ---------- */
  .schedule-section{background:var(--navy);color:var(--cream);}
  .schedule-section .section-head h2{color:var(--cream);}
  .schedule-section .section-head p{color:rgba(248,244,234,0.65);}
  .schedule-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
  .schedule-card{
    background:rgba(248,244,234,0.04);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 28px;
    border-radius:4px;transition:all .35s;
  }
  .schedule-card:hover{background:rgba(248,244,234,0.07);border-color:var(--gold);transform:translateY(-6px);}
  .schedule-card .day{font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);}
  .schedule-card h3{font-size:1.6rem;margin-top:10px;font-weight:500;}
  .schedule-card .time{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2.1rem;color:var(--gold-light);margin-top:14px;}
  .schedule-card .desc{margin-top:10px;color:rgba(248,244,234,0.6);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;}

  /* ---------- pasteur ---------- */
  .pasteur-section .container{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:70px;align-items:start;}
  .pasteur-gallery{position:relative;}
  .pgal-main{border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -20px rgba(14,26,58,0.35);}
  .pgal-main img{width:100%;height:520px;object-fit:cover;transition:opacity .4s ease;}
  .pgal-thumbs{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;}
  .pgal-thumbs img{
    width:64px;height:64px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;
    border:2px solid transparent;opacity:0.6;transition:all .25s;
  }
  .pgal-thumbs img:hover, .pgal-thumbs img.active{border-color:var(--gold);opacity:1;}
  .pasteur-text .role{color:var(--crimson);font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;}
  .pasteur-text h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.2vw,2.7rem);color:var(--navy);margin-top:12px;font-weight:500;}
  .pasteur-text .quote{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--navy-mid);
    margin:24px 0;line-height:1.6;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);padding-left:20px;
  }
  .pasteur-text p.bio{color:#4a4a4a;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1rem;}
  .pasteur-stats{display:flex;gap:40px;margin-top:32px;padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid rgba(14,26,58,0.12);}
  .pasteur-stats .stat h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2.2rem;color:var(--gold);}
  .pasteur-stats .stat span{font-size:0.78rem;color:#666;letter-spacing:0.03em;}

  /* ---------- ministeres ---------- */
  .min-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;}
  .min-card{
    background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(14,26,58,0.08);padding:32px 26px;border-radius:4px;
    transition:all .35s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .min-card::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:3px;background:var(--gold);
    transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .35s;
  }
  .min-card:hover{box-shadow:0 24px 48px -20px rgba(14,26,58,0.2);transform:translateY(-6px);}
  .min-card:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1);}
  .min-card .num{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:0.1em;}
  .min-card h3{font-size:1.25rem;margin-top:14px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:500;}
  .min-card p{margin-top:10px;color:#666;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;}

  /* ---------- dons ---------- */
  .don-section{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, #0a1530 100%);
    color:var(--cream);position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .don-section::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;width:500px;height:500px;border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid var(--line);top:-200px;left:-150px;
  }
  .don-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .don-text .eyebrow{color:var(--gold);}
  .don-text .eyebrow::before{background:var(--gold);}
  .don-text h2{color:var(--cream);font-size:clamp(2rem,3.2vw,2.7rem);font-weight:500;}
  .don-text p{color:rgba(248,244,234,0.68);margin-top:18px;line-height:1.75;}
  .don-methods{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-top:30px;}
  .don-method{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
    background:rgba(248,244,234,0.05);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 22px;border-radius:4px;
  }
  .don-method .m-name{font-weight:500;color:var(--gold-light);}
  .don-method .m-detail{font-size:0.85rem;color:rgba(248,244,234,0.6);}
  .don-verse{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.7rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.55;
    color:var(--gold-light);padding:40px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;
    background:rgba(248,244,234,0.03);
  }
  .don-verse .ref{display:block;margin-top:18px;font-size:0.85rem;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:rgba(248,244,234,0.5);}

  /* ---------- evenements ---------- */
  .event-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
  .event-row{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:100px 1fr auto;gap:30px;align-items:center;
    padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(14,26,58,0.1);transition:padding-left .3s;
  }
  .event-row:hover{padding-left:12px;background:rgba(201,162,39,0.04);}
  .event-date{text-align:center;border-right:1px solid rgba(14,26,58,0.1);padding-right:20px;}
  .event-date .d{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2.1rem;color:var(--crimson);line-height:1;}
  .event-date .m{font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;}
  .event-info h3{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:500;}
  .event-info p{font-size:0.88rem;color:#777;margin-top:4px;}
  .event-tag{font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--gold);border:1px solid var(--gold);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap;}

  /* ---------- contact ---------- */
  .contact-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;}
  .contact-info .item{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-bottom:26px;}
  .contact-info .item .ico{
    width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;
  }
  .contact-info .item h4{color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;}
  .contact-info .item p{color:#666;font-size:0.9rem;margin-top:3px;}
  .contact-form input, .contact-form textarea{
    width:100%;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;border:1px solid rgba(14,26,58,0.15);
    border-radius:3px;font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:0.92rem;background:#fff;
  }
  .contact-form textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical;}
  .contact-form button{
    background:var(--navy);color:var(--cream);padding:15px 34px;border:none;border-radius:3px;
    font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:0.88rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s;
  }
  .contact-form button:hover{background:var(--crimson);}

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{background:#08122b;color:rgba(248,244,234,0.55);padding:60px 0 26px;}
  .footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px;margin-bottom:50px;}
  .footer-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .footer-brand img{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--gold);}
  .footer-brand span{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.15rem;}
  footer h5{color:var(--cream);font-size:0.82rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;}
  footer ul{list-style:none;}
  footer li{margin-bottom:10px;font-size:0.88rem;}
  footer li a:hover{color:var(--gold-light);}
  .footer-bottom{
    border-top:1px solid rgba(248,244,234,0.1);padding-top:24px;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;
  }

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */
  @media(max-width:980px){
    nav ul{display:none;}
    .burger{display:block;}
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:left;}
    .hero-visual{margin-top:60px;max-width:340px;}
    .schedule-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .pasteur-section .container{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .pgal-main img{height:400px;}
    .min-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .don-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .contact-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    section{padding:70px 0;}
  }
  @media(max-width:560px){
    .min-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .event-row{grid-template-columns:70px 1fr;}
    .event-tag{grid-column:1/3;width:fit-content;}
    .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav-wrap">
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Logo Église Couronne Divine">
      <div class="brand-text">
        <div class="name">Couronne Divine</div>
        <div class="tag">Église • Bujumbura</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#accueil">Accueil</a></li>
        <li><a href="#horaires">Cultes</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pasteur">Apôtre</a></li>
        <li><a href="#ministeres">Ministères</a></li>
        <li><a href="#evenements">Événements</a></li>
        <li><a href="#dons">Dons</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <a href="#dons" class="nav-cta">Faire un don</a>
    <div class="burger">☰</div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="accueil">
  <div class="hero-arc arc1"></div>
  <div class="hero-arc arc2"></div>
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="reveal visible">
      <div class="eyebrow">Bienvenue chez vous</div>
      <h1>Une couronne <em>divine</em><br> posée sur chaque vie</h1>
      <p class="verse">« Mais vous, vous êtes une race élue, un sacerdoce royal, une nation sainte. » — 1 Pierre 2:9</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#horaires" class="btn btn-primary">Voir les horaires des cultes</a>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">▶ Suivre en direct</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual reveal visible">
      <div class="hero-globe-ring"></div>
      <img class="hero-photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Apôtre Félix Ngelesa Prince">
      <div class="schedule-chip">
        <div class="lbl">Prochain culte</div>
        <div class="val">Dimanche · 9h00</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="schedule-section" id="horaires">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Programme hebdomadaire</div>
      <h2>Des rendez-vous pour grandir dans la foi</h2>
      <p>Rejoignez-nous en présentiel ou en direct, chaque semaine, pour ces temps forts de communion et d'enseignement.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="schedule-grid">
      <div class="schedule-card reveal">
        <div class="day">Dimanche</div>
        <h3>Culte principal</h3>
        <div class="time">09h00</div>
        <div class="desc">Louange, enseignement et communion fraternelle. Ouvert à tous.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="schedule-card reveal">
        <div class="day">Mercredi</div>
        <h3>Prière & intercession</h3>
        <div class="time">17h30</div>
        <div class="desc">Un temps de prière collective pour l'église, la ville et les nations.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="schedule-card reveal">
        <div class="day">Samedi</div>
        <h3>2000vicedoyen@hau)
</h3>
        <div class="time">18h00</div>
        <div class="desc">Formation biblique approfondie pour les membres et nouveaux venus.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pasteur-section" id="pasteur">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pasteur-gallery reveal">
      <div class="pgal-main">
        <img id="pgalMain" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Apôtre Félix Ngelesa Prince">
      </div>
      <div class="pgal-thumbs">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="active" onclick="switchPhoto(this)">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," onclick="switchPhoto(this)">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," onclick="switchPhoto(this)">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," onclick="switchPhoto(this)">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," onclick="switchPhoto(this)">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pasteur-text reveal">
      <div class="role">Pasteur principal</div>
      <h2>Apôtre Félix Ngelesa Prince</h2>
      <div class="quote">« Notre vocation est de voir chaque vie couronnée par la présence de Dieu — ici, à Bujumbura, et jusqu'aux nations. »</div>
      <p class="bio">Fondateur et berger de l'Église Couronne Divine, l'Apôtre Félix Ngelesa Prince conduit la communauté avec une vision claire : faire de chaque fidèle un ambassadeur du Royaume, enraciné dans la Parole et porteur d'impact dans la société.</p>
      <p class="bio">Prédicateur, formateur et bâtisseur, il consacre son ministère à l'enseignement biblique, à l'accompagnement pastoral et au développement d'une église tournée vers les nations — fidèle à l'esprit du logo qui porte l'église : un globe couronné par la foi.</p>
      <div class="pasteur-stats">
        <div class="stat"><h3>10+</h3><span>Années de ministère</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><h3>500+</h3><span>Membres et fidèles</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><h3>3</h3><span>Cultes hebdomadaires</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="ministeres">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">S'impliquer</div>
      <h2>Des ministères pour chaque appel</h2>
      <p>Chaque département sert la vision de l'église et offre un espace pour grandir et servir selon son don.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="min-grid">
      <div class="min-card reveal">
        <div class="num">Dépt. 01</div>
        <h3>Louange & Adoration</h3>
        <p>Chorale, musiciens et techniciens qui préparent l'atmosphère de chaque culte.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="min-card reveal">
        <div class="num">Dépt. 02</div>
        <h3>Jeunesse</h3>
        <p>Un espace dynamique pour former la génération montante dans la foi.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="min-card reveal">
        <div class="num">Dépt. 03</div>
        <h3>École du dimanche</h3>
        <p>Enseignement biblique adapté aux enfants, dans la joie et la sécurité.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="min-card reveal">
        <div class="num">Dépt. 04</div>
        <h3>Évangélisation</h3>
        <p>Équipes mobilisées pour porter l'Évangile dans les quartiers de Bujumbura.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

